# Dataset B3 – Hazard Synchronization Analysis

## Objective

Evaluate accelerator-aware hazard detection and automatic synchronization mechanisms for MMIO and ISA accelerator interfaces.

---

## MMIO Architecture

### Benchmark Program

```assembly
lui  x1,0x1
addi x2,x0,1

sw   x2,0(x1)

addi x5,x0,5
addi x6,x0,6
addi x7,x0,7

lw   x3,8(x1)

jal  x0,0
```

### Results

Hazard Detection Events:

1

Evidence:

ACCEL RAW HAZARD DETECTED

Result Register Write:

REGFILE WRITE:
we_addr = 3

Result Value:

0x00000000

Result Write Time:

5245000 ns

Status:

PASS

